<title>NETHERLANDS: SNS SECURITIES RATES AKZO NOBEL A BUY.</title>
<headline>SNS SECURITIES RATES AKZO NOBEL A BUY.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Research note summary (31/07)</p>
<p>Company---------Sector--------Price---Broker----------------</p>
<p>Akzo Nobel	chemicals     315.00  SNS Securities</p>
<p>COMMENT: Buy, Selected List (rating 1, previous 2)</p>
<p>After disappointing first-quarter results, second quarter</p>
<p>turned out to be excellent. We expect Akzo Nobel to be able to</p>
<p>show higher profit growth in the years ahead than in the past.</p>
<p>Akzo Nobel has underperformed market by more than 20 percent in</p>
<p>last few months, but we expect this trend to change now.</p>
<p>    Estimates (NLG):  EPS     P/E    Dividend</p>
<p>    1996 (actual)     18.54   12.7    7.50</p>
<p>    1997		  21.90   14.4    8.60</p>
<p>    1998		  25.20   12.5    9.80</p>
<p>    1999		  28.25   11.2   11.00</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom, +31 20 504 5000 (Fax +31 20 504 5040)</p>
